Records
-------

No patient record, expert annotation or clinical trajectory is distributed with this
release. The private multi-centre cohort it describes is not exportable, and the public
auxiliary sources are not named in the manuscript, so none of them is bundled or
linked. Access conditions are recorded in `dataset_urls.txt`.
